el.ai/blog/terminal-bench-4-continuous-qa/"},{"position":7,"site_name":"www.tbench.ai","snippet":"While other benchmarks are rapidly becoming saturated, Terminal-Bench is still a useful benchmark for evaluating the performance of frontier AI agents. In ...","title":"Terminal-Bench on the Claude 4 Model Card","url":"https://www.tbench.ai/news/claude-4"},{"position":8,"site_name":"benchlm.ai","snippet":"Version 4.0 fixes 19 tasks and removes 8 tasks that were saturated, refusal-prone, publicly solved, or still affected by quality and platform issues. Each row ...","title":"Terminal-Bench 4.0 Leaderboard & Scores — October 2026","url":"https://benchlm.ai/benchmarks/terminal-bench-4"},{"date":"Jan 17, 2026","position":9,"site_name":"arxiv.org","snippet":"The Terminal-Bench task formulation is flexible and expressive, allowing for a diverse set of tasks in the benchmark. In order to design a ...","title":"Terminal-Bench: Benchmarking Agents on Hard, Realistic ...","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2601.11868v1"},{"date":"Sep 17, 2026","position":10,"site_name":"tessary.ai","snippet":"Terminal-Bench 4.0, released August 2026, dropped eight of 3.0's 74 tasks, two each for being saturated, refusal-prone, having a publicly ...","title":"What Changed in Terminal-Bench 4.0 - Tessary","url":"https://tessary.ai/answers/terminal-bench/what-changed-in-the-latest-version-of-terminal-bench"}],"total_results":10,"page":0}
